#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:3
#: 6dc09d94ae994224ac9fe2608115d20a
msgid "原子层分组（Layer Groups）"
msgstr "Layer Groups"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:5
#: 691d726b42024aa4b392c74ef48d81fa
msgid "**分类：** 结构"
msgstr "**Category:** Structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:7
#: 374c76677f4e4011bd51435d734db27b
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:9
#: e65ecff643ed4830a87c792e2624b02d
msgid ""
"沿所选 `(hkl)` 晶面法向识别原子层，再把相邻层依次标为 `A、B、A、B…`。 "
"每个输入固定得到一个输出；元素、坐标、晶胞和周期边界不变，只新增或更新逐原子数组 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`。"
msgstr ""
"Identify atomic layers along the normal of the selected `(hkl)` plane, "
"then label adjacent layers in sequence as `A, B, A, B, …`. Each input "
"produces exactly one output. Elements, coordinates, the cell, and "
"periodic boundaries remain unchanged; only the per-atom array "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` is added or updated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:13
#: f3af2a763fb94909933a66c79123947d
msgid ""
"这些标签可供磁序、定向空位或其他读取 `group` 的下游卡片选择原子。它不是结构筛选， 也不会改变元素。`Config_type` 中的 "
"`Grp(...)` 只记录操作来源，不能替代逐原子 `group` 数组。"
msgstr ""
"These labels let downstream cards such as Magnetic Order and oriented-"
"vacancy operations select atoms through `group`. The card neither filters"
" structures nor changes elements. `Grp(...)` in `Config_type` records "
"provenance only; it does not replace the per-atom `group` array."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:16
#: 9c748b05430745439b043eb9ece2fc80
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:18
#: ae458cde3cb34cb7b71a206596a4e382
msgid ""
"设 ASE 晶胞的三条晶格矢量组成矩阵 $\\mathbf A$，Miller 指数为 $\\mathbf h=(h,k,l)^\\mathsf "
"T$。程序使用倒空间法向"
msgstr ""
"Let the three lattice vectors of the ASE cell form the matrix $\\mathbf "
"A$, and let the Miller index be $\\mathbf h=(h,k,l)^\\mathsf T$. The "
"program uses the reciprocal-space normal"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:21
#: 7facc1f43d1344fb88f6d1321cc85b6e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf g=\\mathbf A^{-1}\\mathbf h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf n}=\\frac{\\mathbf g}{\\lVert\\mathbf g\\rVert},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:27
#: 292eab32bd204020b9848b19a8280b8e
msgid "并按原子在该法向上的投影距离"
msgstr "and sorts atoms by their projected distance along this normal:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:29
#: 9bf45b51927b4c2191218a5a8e411ba2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"u_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf n}\n"
"   =\\frac{\\mathbf s_i\\cdot\\mathbf h}{\\lVert\\mathbf g\\rVert}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:34
#: a43fe98c4bed45d394d015bd57606d7a
msgid ""
"排序。这里 $\\mathbf r_i$ 和 $\\mathbf s_i$ 分别是笛卡尔坐标和分数坐标。因此 `(100)` "
"表示晶面指数，不等同于笛卡尔 X 方向；非正交晶胞仍使用真实倒空间法向。"
msgstr ""
"Here $\\mathbf r_i$ and $\\mathbf s_i$ are the Cartesian and fractional "
"coordinates, respectively. Therefore, `(100)` denotes a crystallographic "
"plane index rather than the Cartesian X direction; a non-orthogonal cell "
"still uses its true reciprocal-space normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:37
#: 1dc60b54b6984261a08284e81c0f0be0
msgid ""
"投影区间宽度不超过 `layer_tolerance` 的原子归入同一层。若法向包含周期方向，程序会 "
"按周期相位处理，并把晶胞两端在容差内的同一层合并。第 $\\ell_i$ 层的标签为"
msgstr ""
"Atoms whose projection interval is no wider than `layer_tolerance` are "
"assigned to the same layer. If the normal includes a periodic direction, "
"the program works in periodic phase and merges a layer split across the "
"two cell boundaries when it lies within the tolerance. The label of layer"
" $\\ell_i$ is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:40
#: b127136b35e24b3a81883b985e78873c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\operatorname{group}(i)=\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"\\text{group\\_a}, & \\ell_i\\bmod 2=0,\\\\\n"
"\\text{group\\_b}, & \\ell_i\\bmod 2=1.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:48
#: e58067bc0d024db6b46732afc6da17ae
msgid "输出数量始终为"
msgstr "The output count is always"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:50
#: 35017bff54e643e2b1d1a681f603f659
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:54
#: d97c4b81a10745ddb0883f0f5da4d8a3
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:56
#: 786fa5e2e90d4c3b80ee79a16d8ca80b
msgid ""
"例如 `(100)` 方向检测到四层、各有两个原子时，预览显示 `A(2) → B(2) → A(2) → B(2)`。运行后八个原子的 "
"`group` 数组依次为 `A, A, B, B, A, A, B, B`，结构本身保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"For example, if four layers with two atoms each are detected along "
"`(100)`, the preview shows `A(2) → B(2) → A(2) → B(2)`. After the "
"operation, the eight entries in the `group` array are `A, A, B, B, A, A, "
"B, B`, while the structure itself remains unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:60
#: 42de54806d5c4f598bc3c1b76f8cc68b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:62
#: 6add653f24124739880bad9cd8b9d3e8
msgid "晶面指数（miller_index）"
msgstr "Miller Index (miller_index)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:64
#: 731a7f08a22441e6b873952a2d8a9518
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `001`。可选 `100`、`010`、`001`、`110`、`111`。`(001)` "
"在常见立方和四方常规晶胞中通常能直接形成可检查的交替层；选择的是晶面法向， 不是笛卡尔坐标轴。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `001`. Available choices are `100`, `010`, `001`, `110`, "
"and `111`. In common conventional cubic and tetragonal cells, `(001)` "
"usually gives an alternating layer sequence that is easy to inspect. The "
"selection is a plane normal, not a Cartesian axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:67
#: 839004b399bf4900914ab09c410a2207
msgid "层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "Layer Tolerance (layer_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:69
#: 7bc73cd2c831428e9e4ca304db2acaec
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05 Å`。同层原子因热扰动产生轻微起伏时可适当增大；相邻层被误合并时 应减小。容差必须为正数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.05 Å`. Increase it moderately when thermal "
"displacement gives atoms in one layer a slight corrugation; decrease it "
"if adjacent layers are merged incorrectly. The tolerance must be "
"positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:72
#: 2de738a82d044d828224afd2fa41f283
msgid "A 组标签（group_a）"
msgstr "group_a"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:74
#: f0738a7c3edb4102aa76a3c60e435fb7
msgid "`str`，默认 `A`。写入第 0、2、4…层，不能为空。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `A`. Written to layers 0, 2, 4, and so on. It cannot be "
"empty."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:76
#: c550bf487c034065a3754606f56fff2b
msgid "B 组标签（group_b）"
msgstr "group_b"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:78
#: 8ba5ada3789442a994f3b9adb1a3bc88
msgid "`str`，默认 `B`。写入第 1、3、5…层，不能为空且不能与 `group_a` 相同。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `B`. Written to layers 1, 3, 5, and so on. It cannot be "
"empty or equal to `group_a`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:80
#: 9256f326b5154106bf54ecc7cefcb7e5
msgid "覆盖已有分组（overwrite）"
msgstr "overwrite"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:82
#: a5a66d5e6cdc40f3b3c88dabafa894b2
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认关闭。输入已经包含 `group` 时，关闭会原样保留现有标签；开启才按当前晶面 "
"和容差重新分组。界面会显示首个输入的现有计数或新的层序预览。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, disabled by default. If an input already contains `group`, "
"leaving this off preserves the existing labels unchanged; enable it to "
"regroup using the current plane and tolerance. The interface shows either"
" the existing counts from the first input or a preview of the new layer "
"sequence."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:85
#: fa978419f44548c994e0902729151c9d
msgid "使用与检查"
msgstr "Usage and Checks"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:87
#: 242a57b52cf94818b9b8b69a97697a4d
msgid "选择晶面并查看首个输入的层序与各组原子数。"
msgstr ""
"Select a plane and inspect the layer sequence and atom count of each "
"group for the first input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:88
#: 182b07c1d7b24696a2e3c3cfbe705049
msgid "若只检测到一层，扩胞、换晶面或减小容差；卡片不会把单层结果伪装成有效 A/B 分组。"
msgstr ""
"If only one layer is detected, build a supercell, choose another plane, "
"or reduce the tolerance. The card does not present a single-layer result "
"as a valid A/B grouping."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:89
#: 8146b459e99f439db7baae129a270ced
msgid "若周期方向上是奇数层，普通原子选择仍可使用；周期 A/B 磁序会在边界出现同组相接。"
msgstr ""
"With an odd number of layers along a periodic direction, ordinary atom "
"selection still works, but a periodic A/B magnetic order will place "
"identical groups next to each other across the boundary."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:90
#: 1a28702b9b714a5e8333fc457329725b
msgid "运行后确认输出文件仍包含逐原子 `group` 数组。EXTXYZ 可以保存字符串分组，但转换到 其他格式时需确认该格式不会丢弃自定义逐原子数组。"
msgstr ""
"After running, confirm that the output file still contains the per-atom "
"`group` array. EXTXYZ can preserve string-valued groups, but when "
"converting to another format, verify that it does not discard custom per-"
"atom arrays."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:93
#: 4ee215ff30634b7f84bc27e5cd60e4b4
msgid "典型磁序流程："
msgstr "Typical magnetic-order workflow:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:95
#: 837184025b604708b942b127dfa71ff7
msgid "扩胞 → 原子层分组 → 磁序\n"
msgstr ""
"Super Cell → Layer Groups → Magnetic Order\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:99
#: 4eb46759d1234d459e27fb88c710dfa4
msgid "新建或覆盖标签时，`Config_type` 会追加类似："
msgstr ""
"When labels are created or overwritten, an entry similar to the following"
" is appended to `Config_type`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:101
#: 02fa9cd48cb24ca184b082e0770834b7
msgid "Grp(hkl111,tol=0.05,A/B)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:105
#: 36dea680117342c98bf35b19c008ada3
msgid ""
"旧版卡片曾使用晶胞相位二分或半网格奇偶规则。载入含 `mode` 或 `kvec` 的旧配置时， "
"程序会映射可保留的参数并显示迁移提示；重新运行前应核对新的真实层序预览。"
msgstr ""
"Earlier versions of this card used cell-phase bisection or half-grid "
"parity rules. When loading an old configuration containing `mode` or "
"`kvec`, the program maps parameters that can be retained and displays a "
"migration notice. Check the new physical layer-sequence preview before "
"running it again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:108
#: f6ae9f421f6341c6be6c65298d029024
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:110
#: 9c041180c56a425ba1ec84450396c4b8
msgid "**为什么运行前提示只有一层？** 当前晶面方向上没有足够的独立原子层，或容差过大。 按界面建议扩胞、换晶面或减小容差。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the preview report only one layer?** There are not enough "
"distinct atomic layers along the selected plane normal, or the tolerance "
"is too large. Follow the interface suggestion to build a supercell, "
"choose another plane, or reduce the tolerance."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:113
#: 16b6e61a7c6d43318b94de8f7ccd5511
msgid "**为什么参数改变后仍保留旧标签？** 输入已有 `group`，且“覆盖已有分组”处于关闭状态。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are the old labels retained after changing parameters?** The input "
"already contains `group`, and `Overwrite existing groups` is disabled."

